[
{
"start": 16.628,
"end": 21.763,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Linear is the incident management platform built for speed \u2013 designed for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 15,
"char_end": 102,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 21.763,
"end": 23.002,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Try linear.com today.",
"char_start": 103,
"char_end": 124,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 23.002,
"end": 30.494,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Before we get started, Javier Benavides was on the show discussing how drainage is the design decision with the biggest impact.",
"char_start": 125,
"char_end": 252,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 30.494,
"end": 31.196,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 266,
"char_end": 279,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 31.196,
"end": 34.381,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "And it connects to what we're going to be discussing today.",
"char_start": 280,
"char_end": 339,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 34.381,
"end": 39.648,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "I want to point out something \u2013 Javier Benavides mentioned this same dynamic a couple of episodes ago.",
"char_start": 355,
"char_end": 457,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 39.648,
"end": 41.495,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Tell me a specific example.",
"char_start": 458,
"char_end": 485,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 41.495,
"end": 44.914,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 486,
"char_end": 536,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 44.914,
"end": 51.116,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Honestly, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 550,
"char_end": 642,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 51.116,
"end": 54.756,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox components.",
"char_start": 643,
"char_end": 697,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 54.756,
"end": 59.408,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 698,
"char_end": 767,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 59.408,
"end": 61.31,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 783,
"char_end": 816,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 61.31,
"end": 64.193,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 817,
"char_end": 867,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 64.193,
"end": 64.542,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Sure.",
"char_start": 881,
"char_end": 886,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 64.542,
"end": 71.869,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing are usually more important than minor suspension adjustments.",
"char_start": 887,
"char_end": 992,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 71.869,
"end": 76.753,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "The frame matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 993,
"char_end": 1063,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 76.753,
"end": 77.944,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 1079,
"char_end": 1097,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 77.944,
"end": 81.252,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1098,
"char_end": 1148,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 81.252,
"end": 89.636,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Honestly, risk management in cycling isn't about avoiding crashes altogether; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 1162,
"char_end": 1289,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 89.636,
"end": 93.003,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "We've seen it in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 1290,
"char_end": 1341,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 93.003,
"end": 97.888,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "If you ignore that, you'll end up rebuilding it from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1342,
"char_end": 1416,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 97.888,
"end": 99.648,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Where does that stop working?",
"char_start": 1432,
"char_end": 1461,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 99.648,
"end": 104.678,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 1475,
"char_end": 1551,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 104.678,
"end": 109.377,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1552,
"char_end": 1623,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 109.377,
"end": 111.944,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always fall back on?",
"char_start": 1639,
"char_end": 1690,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 111.944,
"end": 114.36,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this landscape?",
"char_start": 1691,
"char_end": 1739,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 114.36,
"end": 115.729,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1753,
"char_end": 1773,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 115.729,
"end": 124.353,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the track sections change the choice of racing line between practice sessions and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 1774,
"char_end": 1900,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 124.353,
"end": 128.87,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 1901,
"char_end": 1967,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 155.918,
"end": 157.727,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Welcome back to the program.",
"char_start": 1983,
"char_end": 2011,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s01"
},
{
"start": 157.727,
"end": 159.454,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
